   "motion_no": 4,
   "body": "RDA",
   "mover": "Dahle",
   "seconder": "Fotheringham",
   "motion": "direct City and Agency staff to draft a letter to be sent to the Proposed Developer/Property Owner, stating the Agency/City position on the proposal as follows: 1. The City does not currently have any strong objection to the location of housing in the Millrock area as proposed. This position is qualified, as we have not heard any public comment on the proposal; 2. The Agency/City believes the Proposed project could potentially meet Agency/City needs by providing highly desired, more affordable housing at a good location; 3. The City currently does not have any objection to amending the ORD zone regulations to allow housing uses",
